---
description: Prefer small, complete, safe changes and verify behavior.
alwaysApply: true
---

- Inspect relevant code and configuration before editing; follow existing project conventions and touch only what the request needs.
- Prefer existing code and platform features. Avoid speculative abstractions, options, and dependencies.
- Keep the change complete: update affected call sites and add focused tests for meaningful behavior changes.
- Never cut required validation, error handling, security, accessibility, or protection against data loss for brevity.
- Run the narrowest relevant checks available and report what was not checked.
